Equity may tender its XPLR OpCo common units and in exchange receive XPLR common units on a one-for-one basis, or the value of such common units in cash, subject to the terms of an exchange agreement.","section":"Item 1. Business","block":61,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001603145-26-000007","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-02-17","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001603145","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1603145/000160314526000007/xplr-20251231.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/51776836c8d5b523f91b7df14aa33f6ee765cf313ba3e702ad41cd1ec24a67dc.bin","sha256":"51776836c8d5b523f91b7df14aa33f6ee765cf313ba3e702ad41cd1ec24a67dc"}},{"id":"9cd5270deec6621c0c2d8707bc525c2f9c1108203cb17a942a920776bb67db0c","quote":"Clean energy projects – At December 31, 2025, XPLR owned interests in a portfolio of contracted clean energy projects located in 28 states as summarized below:","context":"Table of Contents","section":"Item 1. Business","block":64,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001603145-26-000007","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-02-17","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001603145","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1603145/000160314526000007/xplr-20251231.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/51776836c8d5b523f91b7df14aa33f6ee765cf313ba3e702ad41cd1ec24a67dc.bin","sha256":"51776836c8d5b523f91b7df14aa33f6ee765cf313ba3e702ad41cd1ec24a67dc"}},{"id":"047497704d72718d9966214e6f5331be74397df51954c7a3ef0e6d6decbd5ed1","quote":"| | | | | | | | | | | | | | Technology | | Net MW(a) | | Contract Expiration Wind | | 8,069 | | 2026 – 2051 Solar | | 1,718 | | 2035 – 2051 Battery Storage | | 274 | | 2037 – 2051 | | 10,061 | (b) |","context":"Clean energy projects – At December 31, 2025, XPLR owned interests in a portfolio of contracted clean energy projects located in 28 states as summarized below:","